[00:44.71] It's gone from light to gray
[00:48.27] But I'll move those clouds away
[00:51.57] Letting the sun shine through
[00:54.81] In this ode to you
[00:58.29] Let the demons have their place
[01:01.55] If so it's angels you'll create
[01:05.91] And disguised within the dark
[01:08.83] Light will wait
[01:12.61] My heart, I owe you my soul
[01:22.37] Will you please accept
[01:25.50] Please accept this offer
[01:29.59] This is all for you
[01:33.39] Transcend
[01:37.43] We flip towards the sun
[01:40.14] Wheels skidding on the run
[01:43.89] A flowing sea of red
[01:46.86] The whole city grows
[01:51.25] My heart, I owe you my soul
[02:00.41] Will you please accept
